      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The objects",
      "sourceSha256": "5bc7872272afd8ba3ba1c05870da3f4fc3bbcf6dd322c5e026bf4439026e969d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0005",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "How they respond",
      "sourceSha256": "3efbad1166e24b20fc6f094c135757275e9b2d3f73bd5adfa6e91b073965d30f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0006",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[3]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made for your senses",
      "sourceSha256": "b84c66fcafaa7956dacc09c702469f50db7c8e70157a906b2d5f145517c33047"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0007",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[4]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Availability",
      "sourceSha256": "12f67f8539c46701e62d1c50254cf025c22a992b06fea6d4c0e19705f21f4cac"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0008",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[5]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "All apps",
      "sourceSha256": "01bed311e7d0c963a5f8afe3dd3c99c8140d887d92c602b94b9309fa51b32723"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0009",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Provisional icon",
      "sourceSha256": "274c846c048c2a41dc6b42e06566ba3382ce3fb84dfc08f99988256163239857"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0010",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Something for your hands. Space for your mind.",
      "sourceSha256": "1e63725203af3e1af776567c24098ee517d7538df15927dccd0803a26894bf3e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0011",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[2]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Coming soon",
      "sourceSha256": "4f7d64017689437e6d93f5724f3f797054f3935d98a13148025b616b8db8fb2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0012",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Open the cabinet",
      "sourceSha256": "93e924dc46f16b46a3b770c5b266ac33843ebf22f44555fb5c3872c537251c2b"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0013",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "scroll to reach in",
      "sourceSha256": "8f336d19683904f742f433aaea302d1def507141ae130922089f08ecc347f188"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0014",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#purpose-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Like opening a drawer of well-made objects in a quiet room.",
      "sourceSha256": "5db4c5c321574b3d84417deda987ed7f1ac4c40d00873015f2ec3a04b1fedb9d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0015",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Inner Play is a small cabinet of tactile digital objects. Spin something with weight. Cross the threshold of a switch. Turn, slide, press, hold, and release—and feel the object answer honestly.",
      "sourceSha256": "802ec657bd062bb1962bfb1dae2866cc8b4c9e4069660fd974f42e21a72b383c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0016",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Not a task. Not a lesson. Not a score to improve. Somewhere for the hand to go.",
      "sourceSha256": "e41c17a93bf25b041a30e52b7e92f27883ad5f5b998d3ba0eed65cb7fc90cf68"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0017",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#objects/ul[1]/li[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Spin",
      "sourceSha256": "b9e96ae52a7b7115022a979b3151221b0e6e9ce0c219933b2d84b29a7f47ecc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0018",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#objects/ul[1]/li[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Switch",
      "sourceSha256": "39921a740bf2b67802a2042e1f87e9dec566131c2458aba5683e2827ced0d2c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0019",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#objects/ul[1]/li[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Slide",
      "sourceSha256": "6bb4c1177681ec4eb53bb315e71185f702e52f845cc7ff3ae114c41464f67510"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0020",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#objects/ul[1]/li[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Press & hold",
      "sourceSha256": "bbe7c64270b743d430f3157ae9aa650628c766b7d602c07f7d0a93b4a6170835"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0021",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Does the hand believe it?",
      "sourceSha256": "91129933a4859b62dcef77c38ac917944522342c3de11df45f1b7eb101fc157d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0022",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every response comes from the same physical state.",
      "sourceSha256": "59e5b2b1cb1b4330534905a613def7c9dc263432a8ee8ca37ec5cf590fdacf51"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0023",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "An object feels real when its movement, resistance, sound, haptics, and visible state agree. Inner Play is being built so touch creates the response—not a canned animation pretending that it did.",
      "sourceSha256": "2a1f0e5623bc4f611b63c4849c5ec809121069bad9a276b1c03359b8db72bdad"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0024",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Movement with consequence",
      "sourceSha256": "6da32e3325c6ef6f21923ed4679039d9409d1d496b606b8a417edd106175d5c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0025",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Momentum, thresholds, travel, friction, and rest belong to the object.",
      "sourceSha256": "60e30d7e519b0ea0f10db38f84d906488b243fc73c4a284de1500d98374ede66"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0026",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Sound made by motion",
      "sourceSha256": "a330a7e298bec223b07141b0a8dbf742fbeff45eafecc9a7e20d8d7db50ca5b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0027",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[2]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Speed, contact, and position shape what you hear and when you hear it.",
      "sourceSha256": "91977e5e27fd0e74dad65177b3752f4bb637fc431c192cece3df3192d0928925"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0028",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Haptics with a reason",
      "sourceSha256": "75ed19fcbb43677083e26b09fe24a2b41439439ca8c637bc6cb1ff4b8e01f3ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0029",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[3]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Detents, texture, actuation, and release are felt at meaningful moments.",
      "sourceSha256": "6bc66fa456f253c1b70c69206b8951884906faa6524a6237461f006b8dcd7381"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0030",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "State that stays true",
      "sourceSha256": "b59085479459fdbf015393f7bfb7621eb72395640ca9d51362cdfd59db6bd6c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0031",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#response/div[1]/div[4]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The object remains where the interaction left it until something moves again.",
      "sourceSha256": "caed652c4e71d16c28992db1923434d0369bbdf66e4824906ed4171a810ec831"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0032",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[5]/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Play without pressure",
      "sourceSha256": "35f3fbb5f7ff4aaee2bc89bec852b1a984dd885f03201f8da32ba018c3cf8fdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0033",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#quiet-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "No streaks. No scores. No demand to return.",
      "sourceSha256": "af4422aa4c0ee29e357ddb139ccc7eff2a3da2368f9a831c33e2a31e0b609b27"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0034",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[5]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Inner Play can be satisfying without becoming loud, and playful without becoming childish. Open the cabinet, use what feels right, and leave without penalty.",
      "sourceSha256": "9c8c6c0dbbbbca94db11333aa6f9532e998e4e97c54e63c7a00d724bbb7f7afc"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0035",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[5]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "It offers sensory play and focus-friendly interaction without making medical promises.",
      "sourceSha256": "efc98fff0cc4299332ffea1c98715a9b2775274b07b1eea1b76c9c48d528c266"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0036",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made for your senses",
      "sourceSha256": "b84c66fcafaa7956dacc09c702469f50db7c8e70157a906b2d5f145517c33047"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0037",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Rich when you want it. Complete when something is off.",
      "sourceSha256": "25501c6145841353f5fd5ea861fab762c547befed74b9d1b1c9671f76485236c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0038",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Sound and haptics will have independent controls. Silence is a complete mode. Reduce Motion preserves understandable cause and effect with less continuous movement. VoiceOver exposes the object, its state, and meaningful ways to act on it.",
      "sourceSha256": "69c21a287d89e67dd5e37000d6ab699eeb96b1d174d72f2758999dbc9f4cb7cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0039",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/ul[1]/li[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "No state depends only on color, sound, motion, sight, or haptic feedback.",
      "sourceSha256": "9562221efccef2bf8fdd8cb78b4ab894b2822b3affd2e1f0a2f7a89c7bbddb23"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0040",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/ul[1]/li[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every primary object remains usable with sound or haptics disabled.",
      "sourceSha256": "0d07f68208ee3cfadb3af7947e50e9ed9022e474619d2f3c2a08d7debd5cdad6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0041",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/ul[1]/li[3]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Touch targets and alternative actions are part of the object from the beginning.",
      "sourceSha256": "f2b2e15bb80e768b0d1419a6507a3334df7d3dab55b6be4187ff4b88c6fdd710"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0042",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#access/ul[1]/li[4]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Accessibility is part of deciding what the object is—not something added around it.",
      "sourceSha256": "5021611c5274d93e515fe5a076820e75a5c10aaa88259d4e51e72c6f4b313ba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0043",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#blessing-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "An intention for Inner Play",
      "sourceSha256": "da542a347a2759ed5ad41e1903cdd29bca09bc7d319777c66c4c91412225a572"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0044",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[7]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "May every object answer the hand honestly.",
      "sourceSha256": "87c5c9d59571afb3f52c0400fd8f5bade067e726879782ad1d4e37feccef2d9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0045",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[7]/p[1]/text()[2]",
      "source": "May movement make room without making demands.",
      "sourceSha256": "bf3b641d21f364286855dc1a6b74b998eb7a6acc787b187848e9f9cb40fef867"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0046",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[7]/p[1]/text()[3]",
      "source": "May play remain simple, dignified, and free.",
      "sourceSha256": "e1e64fd70eab75c05ac77e2e1c88af6411ccd8e4f635f4a2fb3d131e80489b93"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0047",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[8]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "by Moving Truth",
      "sourceSha256": "3daa3456fa0b55162e7c72b8d69a3fff181d034edf3423bcf3ce5a972cf2aab4"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0048",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[8]/small[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made with love by Skylaur Roe",
      "sourceSha256": "8973d1d4a4d34a688cb6e6d9080ec19b076e65b44fac74776e850e1cfb0f6562"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0049",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[8]/a[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Explore all Moving Truth apps",
      "sourceSha256": "1a8f383841d7faff0dd5d4232e122c1fc9c9cd70a6081e1df6caffd492edc277"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0050",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Coming soon",
      "sourceSha256": "4f7d64017689437e6d93f5724f3f797054f3935d98a13148025b616b8db8fb2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0051",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "The first objects are taking shape.",
      "sourceSha256": "37b2cb01e904685f7ea374320b186c906d118020c1a0899bff57b234a09e232a"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0052",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Inner Play is being built natively for iPhone. Its first proof begins with one believable spinner and one physical switch before the cabinet grows.",
      "sourceSha256": "3c4caa23850544e807e6efbeb7d1c6c7d72702f69e407cbb42debfa0816c3c0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0053",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Ask about Inner Play",
      "sourceSha256": "699e474a0dbf07560a472f30bc8cbfad9e5ba97ae4af089359b441a8984df6f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0054",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The objects",
      "sourceSha256": "5bc7872272afd8ba3ba1c05870da3f4fc3bbcf6dd322c5e026bf4439026e969d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0055",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "How they respond",
      "sourceSha256": "3efbad1166e24b20fc6f094c135757275e9b2d3f73bd5adfa6e91b073965d30f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0056",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[3]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Accessibility",
      "sourceSha256": "d3368cbffe23c98da887d279a1b5c74b7618ba5c0488cbed30cf304f8f9398a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0057",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[4]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Support",
      "sourceSha256": "be91940b79f469101df9a50544b6873aa5509a12f1f93f1cb5e3be3990d344b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0058",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/nav[1]/ul[1]/li[5]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "All apps",
      "sourceSha256": "01bed311e7d0c963a5f8afe3dd3c99c8140d887d92c602b94b9309fa51b32723"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.text.0059",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/html[1]/body[1]/footer[1]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "© 2026 Inner Play by Moving Truth. Coming to iPhone.",
      "sourceSha256": "d8c16a6c664154c3d3f2b63df3c91803c20ad82dcd1e810b4e944990bde98de8"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-play.index.attribute.0001",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "attribute",
